# Constitution

`AGENTS.md` is mandatory. Product truth lives in `docs/`. If code and docs disagree, fix them together in the same change.

Do not add application code that violates `docs/requirements.md` (ranking modes, reject reason + comment, reversible bans with appeal state, header auth, no deletes for bans, pagination).

Do not invent a different repo layout than `docs/project-structure.md`. New architectural choices go in `docs/decisions.md`.
